---
// Midlertidig plassholder mens den nye siden bygges.
---

<html lang="nb">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/favicon.png" />
    <title>Sande Sykkelklubb</title>
    <style>
      :root {
        color-scheme: dark;
      }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        background: #0d1824;
        color: #fff;
        font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 1rem;
      }
      img {
        width: 96px;
        height: 96px;
        object-fit: contain;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 6vw, 3rem);
        margin: 1rem 0 0.5rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      }
      p {
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
        margin: 0;
      }
      a {
        color: #fff;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <img src="/favicon.png" alt="Sande Sportsklubb logo" />
      <h1>Sande Sykkelklubb</h1>
      <p>Ny nettside er under bygging. Inntil videre: <a href="https://sanderittet.no">sanderittet.no</a></p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
